1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,199
Bro borrowed five hundred bucks and paid back almost two grand.

2
00:00:04,049 --> 00:00:06,482
The fine print said six fifty. So… how?

3
00:00:07,332 --> 00:00:09,647
Scott Tucker's payday loans auto-renewed.

4
00:00:09,847 --> 00:00:12,085
Tap the heart if you never read fine print.

5
00:00:12,335 --> 00:00:15,951
He'd take a hundred fifty in fees, and the five hundred? Still— still there.

6
00:00:16,201 --> 00:00:18,313
Send this to your 'it's a small fee' friend.

7
00:00:18,563 --> 00:00:21,924
One borrower paid nineteen twenty-five, per the Justice Department.

8
00:00:22,174 --> 00:00:24,569
And the jury? Guilty on all fourteen counts.

9
00:00:25,419 --> 00:00:27,623
Follow, this page reads fine print for you.

10
00:00:28,023 --> 00:00:30,875
He got over sixteen years.

11
00:00:31,775 --> 00:00:33,812
Five hundred bucks. Would you have read it?
